<title>USA: Yes Entertainment names Nemetz vice chmn.</title>
<headline>Yes Entertainment names Nemetz vice chmn.</headline>
<dateline>PLEASANTON, Calif. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yes! Entertainment Tuesday named Gary Nemetz to the newly-created post of vice chairman.</p>
<p>Nemetz is a director of the company and chairman of its Audit and Finance Committees.</p>
</text>
